## Cursor protocol descriptor

`hermes_cursor_provider/cursor_protocol/agent_pb2.py` embeds a protobuf descriptor recovered in PR #40876 for Cursor's undocumented `agent.v1` service. The schema did not carry an independent license or provenance header. The repository includes it solely because the direct protocol cannot function without its message definitions. This implementation is unofficial and may implicate Cursor's contractual restrictions on reverse engineering; users must make their own legal and account-risk assessment.